{
  "$comment": "AEP profile of the security-audit findings schema (vendored pin c1c8a8c, reference/security-audit-skill/skills/security-audit/report-schema.json). This profile differs from the vendored schema ONLY by deltas P1-P4, each forced by a distortion recorded in Q2 of docs/security-audit-spikes-2026-10-26.md; see docs/security-audit-protocol.md, profile section. P1: execution.attacker_perspective is optional, not required (confirmed branch). P2: execution.payloads semantics are the constructed input / supplied state changes as data, not attacker payloads. P3: trace entry kind gains 'composition' for cross-component / non-code trace entries. P4: for a no-execution (static-proof) confirmed record, execution.instructions are the constructed-trace re-walk steps and execution.observed_result is the invariant violation as walked, not an execution observation.",
